{
 "slug": "pepper-alternative",
 "pageId": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
 "text_batches": [
  [
   {
    "label": "t0",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "c3df870f-ba8c-9aaf-796c-bb1249eeefa3"
     },
     "text": "20-30 Min"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t1",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fe9d"
     },
     "text": "Saved on each order that moves off the phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t2",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "3027ca32-6180-79a6-1a66-d9f911e27a08"
     },
     "text": "24-48 Hrs"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t3",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fea2"
     },
     "text": "Is when most distributors go live"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t4",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "448bf1fe-361f-3c13-6268-4572092953ba"
     },
     "text": "24/7"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t5",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5feac"
     },
     "text": "Is when orders can come in"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t6",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "1cd5e3b3-4adf-89d2-b8a1-ba35fe69754d"
     },
     "text": "Where It Starts"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t7",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8be"
     },
     "text": "Why an alternative to Pepper gets searched for"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t8",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8c2"
     },
     "text": "Pepper, from Pomegranate Technologies, sells an AI-first platform to independent distributors: a storefront, an Order Agent for order entry, and hubs for sales, finance, pricing and marketing. It is a lot of product, and most of it earns its place. What sends a buyer to look at a Pepper competitor is usually far narrower than the platform."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t9",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "eb7fd825-30c6-7275-9a2f-c98f68eb960f"
     },
     "text": "The phone accounts are still phoning"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t10",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8cc"
     },
     "text": "A storefront only helps the kitchens that open it. The rest keep calling, texting and leaving voicemails at the end of a shift, and those are the orders your desk still writes up by hand."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t11",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "bacfcf90-d337-55e1-9a02-49b2f6962e16"
     },
     "text": "On the Order Agent path, you do the checking"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t12",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8d3"
     },
     "text": "Order Agent reads the voicemail, text, photo or PDF the kitchen already sent. Pepper's own product page describes no step where the kitchen confirms what was read, so your order desk is the first person to see it written down."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t13",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "83921d0d-4ec1-911e-4420-fee5bfd13614"
     },
     "text": "One more rollout is the last thing you need"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t14",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8da"
     },
     "text": "Pepper publishes 35 to 90 days for a typical go-live, across five phases, with an implementation manager and a deployed engineer assigned. Fair for a platform that size. Going through anything like it again for one channel is not, and no Pepper alternative should ask you to."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t15",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "f5b08e4d-7503-2dae-cdd2-6f455d9fe83d"
     },
     "text": "A Pepper alternative that adds instead of replacing"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t16",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "f49b7c29-2a8e-b047-d714-742b52e0a34c"
     },
     "text": "What You Get"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t17",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "d4031fde-2fc3-b283-bb1c-784e741d725b"
     },
     "text": "Voice Ordering"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t18",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0ed"
     },
     "text": "They talk. It comes out as a list."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t19",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0f1"
     },
     "text": "A chef counts the walk-in and says what is short. Each item turns into a line you can read, with the quantity beside it. Nothing to type, no time on hold, and no voicemail for your team to piece together in the morning."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t20",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4133"
     },
     "text": "They press to speak, then read the lines back before sending"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t21",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4139"
     },
     "text": "From the cooler or the line, whatever time the shift ends"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t22",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe413f"
     },
     "text": "20 to 30 minutes back against the same order by phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t23",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4145"
     },
     "text": "Nobody writes up a reorder from an account on the app, so the reps get that time to sell"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t24",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "d5d6538b-4114-51aa-7fff-aad875b7bfe3"
     },
     "text": "Order Guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t25",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea2"
     },
     "text": "Each account gets a list of its own"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t26",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea6"
     },
     "text": "You hand over the guides each kitchen already buys from. We load each one against your SKUs at the prices you hold for that account, so a spoken item lands on the right line against your own SKU."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t27",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdead"
     },
     "text": "Each account sees only what it actually orders from you"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t28",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb3"
     },
     "text": "Your prices, your SKUs, under your control, not the customer's"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t29",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb9"
     },
     "text": "Change a guide once and it holds from then on"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t30",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdebf"
     },
     "text": "You keep the catalog; the customer gets the convenience"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t31",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "6555f9fc-4dcc-b940-f384-6001ce4db69f"
     },
     "text": "Delivery Formats"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t32",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb118"
     },
     "text": "The order shows up in a shape you already handle"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t33",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb11c"
     },
     "text": "Nobody in your office has to work somewhere new. Finished orders go out as email with a PDF, Excel or Word file, or straight into your ERP over the API, over EDI, or into QuickBooks."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t34",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb123"
     },
     "text": "Email goes to a rep or straight to your purchasing team"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t35",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb129"
     },
     "text": "Nothing to retype over EDI, QuickBooks or the API"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t36",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb12f"
     },
     "text": "Your pick, invoice and delivery steps stay exactly as they are"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t37",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb135"
     },
     "text": "Nothing in your stack has to come out first"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t38",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "099f67ce-06ef-dc92-c6e6-fdc4481f359f"
     },
     "text": "Inventory Visibility"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t39",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93a"
     },
     "text": "Watch stock move as the orders land"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t40",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93e"
     },
     "text": "VoiceOrder Solutions gives you real-time inventory visibility tied to what is being ordered, and the catalog updates as levels change. It is not where your stock lives: your own inventory system stays in charge, and a demo covers how the two connect."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t41",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df945"
     },
     "text": "Visibility across the catalog, not just the fast movers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t42",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df94b"
     },
     "text": "Stockouts surprise you less often when a big order lands late"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t43",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df951"
     },
     "text": "Stock figures come from the system doing your counting today"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t44",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df957"
     },
     "text": "Counting never happens in our app"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t45",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "021e8cc1-41f6-a5cc-3995-2a8c101d005c"
     },
     "text": "Side By Side"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t46",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64e7"
     },
     "text": "What Pepper keeps and what the voice step adds"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t47",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64ec"
     },
     "text": "VoiceOrder Solutions is no Pepper replacement, and it is not trying to be one. Nothing has to come out for it to go in, so the platform you rolled out stays exactly where it is."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t48",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da6507"
     },
     "text": "Keep the storefront, add the voice"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t49",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da650a"
     },
     "text": "Some accounts are never going to browse a catalog. They will talk instead, late in the evening, from the walk-in. The storefront stays for the ones who tap, and our app picks up the ones who talk."
    }
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "label": "t50",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a6d"
     },
     "text": "Try it on the accounts still calling"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t51",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a70"
     },
     "text": "It goes in beside Pepper without a project, so you can start with the handful of accounts that never adopted the storefront and judge it on those before deciding anything bigger."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t52",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535624"
     },
     "text": "The ERP keeps being the one destination"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t53",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535627"
     },
     "text": "Both feed the system you have, so adding our app does not change where an order ends up. It arrives over EDI, the API or QuickBooks into the system your people already use, or by email as a file."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t54",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b4"
     },
     "text": "Follow one spoken order from a kitchen to your desk"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t55",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b8"
     },
     "text": "Book 20 minutes. We take one order through to the format it arrives in, so you can see where it lands beside your Pepper orders."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t56",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "6923bf1d-5310-eba9-bcb8-7266c5f85e97"
     },
     "text": "Getting Started"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t57",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ec7"
     },
     "text": "Three steps, and no migration to schedule"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t58",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "38293a1d-fb4c-9501-8014-28855f9128b6"
     },
     "text": "There is nothing to migrate here, and Pepper is left as it is. Send us the guides your office works from, and we do the loading."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t59",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ed6"
     },
     "text": "Send over your guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t60",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5eda"
     },
     "text": "Whatever form they are in now. We load each account's items and your prices into one admin screen, matched to your SKUs."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t61",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ede"
     },
     "text": "Your accounts get the app"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t62",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ee3"
     },
     "text": "We create the account and the kitchen downloads the app. Most are ordering before that day is out."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t63",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f00"
     },
     "text": "It shows up ready"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t64",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f04"
     },
     "text": "Confirmed by the customer, with a number and the time it was sent, in the format your system takes."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t65",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a176"
     },
     "text": "Pepper with VoiceOrder Solutions beside it."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t66",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "0c6cf9c7-bbe3-a64d-76b9-1539a90ac7c8"
     },
     "text": "One step added."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t67",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "7b8acd63-aca8-b070-4eb6-f64ce47abebc"
     },
     "text": "Both, Not One"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t68",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a179"
     },
     "text": "Adding a tool should never leave you with less, and the table reads that way. Pepper sells a broad platform to independents, and a Pepper alternative search usually means one channel is still on the phone. So here is Pepper alone, then Pepper with our app next to it. The two do not connect, and every Pepper detail is from their own site."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t69",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "1ff87819-9b94-6168-dfbb-e81fd6a5b236"
     },
     "text": "Feature"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t70",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a18d"
     },
     "text": "Pepper + VoiceOrder Solutions"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t71",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a19e"
     },
     "text": "Pepper on its own"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t72",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1be"
     },
     "text": "Kitchens say the order into an app and read it back"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t73",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "89a5813a-10f6-6ba1-6eed-d733971a550a"
     },
     "text": "Voicemails and texts read by Order Agent"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t74",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1c8"
     },
     "text": "A storefront built for digital ordering"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t75",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1d5"
     },
     "text": "The buyer reviews every line before it sends"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t76",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1e2"
     },
     "text": "Hubs for reps, collections, margin and ads"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t77",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1ec"
     },
     "text": "Its own guide for every account, at your prices"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t78",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1f6"
     },
     "text": "A number and a timestamp on the order"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t79",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a210"
     },
     "text": "Storefront orders arrive with no call to take"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t80",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a21a"
     },
     "text": "Reps spend less of the day on order admin"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t81",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a224"
     },
     "text": "Orders land in the ERP you already run"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t82",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "30f8c397-6bf9-f190-2eb1-183dc2b44d9e"
     },
     "text": "FAQ"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t83",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf956"
     },
     "text": "Questions from distributors who are keeping Pepper"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t84",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "8bf0eb84-6a8d-dd56-6a0e-8116d9416d3d"
     },
     "text": "Do we need a Pepper alternative so kitchens can check their own spoken orders?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t85",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf967"
     },
     "text": "No. Pepper can stay as it is, Order Agent included, while we add an app where kitchens say what they need and check every item themselves. The ones already ordering on Pepper's storefront carry on there. Nothing has to be switched off to try it."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t86",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "ad9f0390-a776-7031-a95b-984cd1988c9e"
     },
     "text": "Is VoiceOrder Solutions better than Pepper?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t87",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf973"
     },
     "text": "Not at running the whole business on one platform: storefront, reps, collections and pricing. Pepper is built wide for that, and we are not trying to be. Where we help is narrower: a reorder your account speaks and signs off, and plenty of people looking for a Pepper alternative turn out to want exactly that one thing."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t88",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "e219e293-819b-221b-6d80-7f8d2898a4d7"
     },
     "text": "Is there a link between VoiceOrder Solutions and Pepper?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t89",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf97f"
     },
     "text": "None. We have no connection to Pepper and no shared support arrangement. Each product hands its orders to your own system separately, ours by email with a file attached, over EDI or the API, or into QuickBooks. When ours go in by a direct feed, both land in the same system; by email, ours arrive as a file your team opens like any other."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t90",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "39590628-381c-9aea-6095-0746f7348939"
     },
     "text": "Will our accounts be juggling Pepper's storefront and your app?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t91",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf98b"
     },
     "text": "They should not have to. Kitchens already ordering through the storefront can stay on it. Offer our app to the ones who still call, text or leave a voicemail, because those orders cost your desk the most time. Anyone who keeps calling is handled as now, with no order number from us, since numbers come only with what our app sends."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t92",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "0f73d180-08e9-596f-f264-a95de40f9593"
     },
     "text": "How quickly can we actually be taking orders?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t93",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "7e541655-5a68-8f96-1273-8249a5c759bd"
     },
     "text": "Most distributors reach that point in a day or two, and most of their customers send a first order the same day. There is no IT project and Pepper runs throughout, which is a very different job from the window Pepper publishes for standing up its whole platform."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t94",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "d9956fbb-a3d6-4b04-b3ab-98b6f5ae509f"
     },
     "text": "What does VoiceOrder Solutions charge?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t95",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "4446ea80-4c7a-f2a8-f0de-0a222818c94f"
     },
     "text": "We quote by distributor, so tell us about your operation and we will price it. Pepper quotes too and publishes no rate card. Since you would be keeping Pepper, the figure worth asking for is what our app adds on top."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t96",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "93ba65b0-4eb0-c64e-d0c0-933cd7a92b1d"
     },
     "text": "Do our customers need new hardware or a tablet?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t97",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf997"
     },
     "text": "No. Our app runs on the iOS or Android phone already in their pocket. We send nothing out, there is nothing to bolt to a counter, and no device for you to support."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t98",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-990427524516"
     },
     "text": "Where do the Pepper details on this page come from?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t99",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6ac9efa5b080336cebb1456a",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-99042752451e"
     },
     "text": "Pepper's own website. The module list, the storefront and Order Agent descriptions and the implementation window were all read off usepepper.com on 10 October 2026, including their own post on how long an implementation takes. We have not repeated their marketing numbers here. If any of it has changed since, this page is the thing that is out of date, not them."
    }
   }
  ]
 ],
